data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_RESULT","toolCallId":"call_00_N1m63MymfNj7N5wRTtyJ9082","messageId":"b7dfa6fc-6895-4132-8435-30ff2a7c895a","content":"{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"status\":\"available\",\"referenceOnly\":true,\"creatorVersion\":\"0.0.1\",\"versions\":{\"@za38.03/agent-ui-core\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-renderer\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-runtime\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-web-component\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-creator\":\"0.0.1\"},\"sourceDigest\":\"9130fc9dbe139ddf8b8a07f221ffe9201199bdd9bb4fcb76047b661fb466adf1\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/scoped-renderer-plugin\",\"title\":\"å…¬å¼€åˆåŒ\",\"source\":\"internal\",\"topic\":\"æ’ä»¶å¼€å‘ä¸Žç»„åˆ\",\"path\":\"references/docs/architecture/scoped-renderer-plugin.md\",\"summary\":\"render scopeã€renderer å­æ’æ§½ã€æ¶ˆæ¯/å·¥å…·å±•ç¤ºåŠ Lexical ç¼–è¾‘ç”Ÿå‘½å‘¨æœŸã€‚\",\"sha256\":\"d3b355efeb0b076c8bd97c876a5aa1b3fa284beada0ad47078e6e8f68da1570c\",\"sectionId\":\"s5\",\"offset\":0,\"totalCharacters\":650,\"content\":\"## å…¬å¼€åˆåŒ\\n\\nä»Ž `@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins/contracts` ä½¿ç”¨ UIPluginComponentPropsã€UIPluginRenderScope å’Œ PluginChildSlotDefinitionã€‚\\n\\n- `renderSlot(name, fallback?, options?)` æ¸²æŸ“æ™®é€šå­å†…å®¹ï¼›options æ”¯æŒ layout çš„ stack/inline å’Œ sizing çš„ content/fillã€‚\\n- `renderScopedSlot(name, { kind, value }, fallback?)` æ¸²æŸ“å¸¦ä½œç”¨åŸŸçš„å­æ’ä»¶ã€‚\\n- å­æ’ä»¶é€šè¿‡ `@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins` çš„ `usePluginRenderScope()` è¯»å– scopeï¼Œæ£€æŸ¥å®žé™… kind åŽä½¿ç”¨ valueã€‚\\n- éœ€è¦ scope çš„ Plugin å£°æ˜Ž requiresRenderScopeï¼›ä¸èƒ½æŠŠå®ƒå½“æˆæ™®é€šé™æ€å†…å®¹æŒ‚è½½ã€‚\\n- æœªé€‰æ‹©ã€ç¦ç”¨æˆ–ä¸å¯ç”¨çš„ renderer ä¸ä¼šè§¦å‘å¦ä¸€å¥— Plugin è‡ªåŠ¨æ³¨å†Œã€‚çˆ¶çº§æ˜Žç¡®å£°æ˜Žçš„ fallback æ˜¯é™çº§å†…å®¹ï¼Œä¸æ˜¯éšå¼æ¢å¤è¢«ç§»é™¤çš„å®žä¾‹ã€‚\\n\\nRuntime ç»§ç»­ç®¡ç† Plugin èº«ä»½ã€æ¿€æ´»ã€Service å’Œ SlotRegistryã€‚scope æ˜¯å½“å‰å®žä½“å±•ç¤ºæ•°æ®ï¼Œä¸æ˜¯å¦ä¸€å¥— Runtime Contextï¼Œä¹Ÿä¸æ˜¯ä»»æ„è·¨æ’ä»¶çŠ¶æ€æ€»çº¿ï¼›å…±äº«èƒ½åŠ›ä½¿ç”¨ Serviceã€‚\\n\\n\",\"nextOffset\":null}}","role":"tool"}

